@Web_HostAddress = http://localhost:5249

### Registrar usuario (nuevo usuario)
POST {{Web_HostAddress}}/api/auth/register
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "Mati",
    "email": "mati@example.com",
    "password": "UnaClaveSegura123"
}

###

### Iniciar sesión
POST {{Web_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email": "mati@example.com",
    "password": "UnaClaveSegura123"
}

###

### Consultar usuarios (reemplazar el token por accessToken devuelto por login)
@accessToken = pegar-token-aqui
GET {{Web_HostAddress}}/api/user
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Accept: application/json